# =============================================================================
# .dockerignore — build context filter for the cti-app image.
# Rules:
#   * Always exclude secrets & local state from the context.
#   * Exclude the OLD baked-tree output (frontend/) so docker-compose Stage-1
#     cannot silently rebuild the superseded vanilla SPA and clobber web/.
#   * DO NOT ignore web/ — it is the Phase-1 live source bake from Stage 1.
#   * web/node_modules + web/dist are stamped by the Stage-1 `npm ci`/build
#     inside the image, but they sit in the COPY web/. payload too — ignore
#     the heavyweight ones here so the context stays lean (they are rebuilt
#     deterministically in-image from web/package-lock.json).
.env
**/.env
.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/chdata/
frontend/
**/frontend/
frontend_legacy/node_modules/
frontend_legacy/dist/
**/frontend_legacy/node_modules/
**/frontend_legacy/node_modules/
**/frontend_legacy/dist/
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
node_modules/
.git/
*.md
adr/
